<title>USA: Sapient files for 1.04 mln share offering.</title>
<headline>Sapient files for 1.04 mln share offering.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sapient Corp said Wednesday it had filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 1.04 million common shares.  </p>
<p>The company said it would offer 500,000, while some of its shareholders would offer the remaining 540,000, including its co-chief executive officers.</p>
<p>It said Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co and Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc would handle the offering.</p>
<p>Sapient designs, develops and implements information technology applications and solutions for large organizations.</p>
